From b6f393ad03b7a0a432d6febbe287dd2a6e356b13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Cheng <chengyuejia@foxmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 22:27:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(knorm): add static and registry tests for unified
 activation conditions

Add test_knorm_runner_static.py to verify via AST that gpu_model_runner
guards all Knorm code paths (_knorm_active for wrapper install,
_knorm_wrapper_installed for collect/attach) so no half-enabled state
can occur.

Add test_knorm_is_not_registered_when_disabled_even_without_prefix_caching
to verify the manager is not registered when VLLM_KNORM_ENABLED=0 even
if prefix caching is off, matching the runner-side guard.

Refs #163
---
